      "hash64": "52A8E16EF1BB79F7",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)][VAR 0x0100(0000)], darling! It’s been\\nmuch\\r\\ntoo\\r\\nlong![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
