    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "52A8E06EF1BB7844",
      "text": "When I heard you’d requested my coaching\\nservices, I couldn’t wait![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "52A8E36EF1BB7D5D",
      "text": "I hopped right in one of those chic Flying Taxis\\nand had ’em get me here chop-chop.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "52A8E26EF1BB7BAA",
      "text": "I’m a little worried my class will overstimulate\\nthese kids, though.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "52A8DD6EF1BB732B",
      "text": "But you’ll take the fall for me if anything goes\\nwrong, won’t you?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05",
      "hash64": "52A8DC6EF1BB7178",
      "text": "Glad to hear you’d be my knight in sparkly lip\\ngloss! But don’t worry, darling—I was kidding.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp01_05b",
      "hash64": "305FAA84C1812F2E",
      "text": "Awww. Got you shook with that one, did I?\\nDon’t worry, cutie—I was only kidding.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "FC4317675651B988",
      "text": "I’m absolutely thrilled you invited me back.[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
