      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_gym_esper_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "FC4318675651BB3B",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]By the way, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], do you\\nremember\\r\\nwhat\\r\\nline\\r\\nof\\r\\nwork\\r\\nI’m in?[VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
