      "hash64": "FC4319675651BCEE",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]No, no, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], not at all.\\nThough\\r\\nflight\\r\\nattendants\\r\\ndo\\r\\ntend\\r\\nto\\r\\nlook\\r\\nimpeccable,\\r\\nlike me.\\c\\nI’m a makeup artist. Do remember that![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
