      "hash64": "F7C0B697ACE361E4",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]No, no, [VAR 0x0100(0000)], not at all.\\nNow\\r\\nBrassius,\\r\\nthat\\r\\noddball\\r\\nwho\\r\\nchurns\\r\\nout\\r\\nstrange\\r\\nstatues...\\r\\nYou\\r\\ncould\\r\\ncall\\r\\nHIM\\r\\na\\r\\n“made-up”\\r\\nartist.\\c\\nI’m a MAKE-up artist. Do remember that![VAR 0x0114(001C)]",
